    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Education Theme is ideal for educational websites like schools, colleges, universities, coaching institutes, online course providers, and training centers. With one-click demo import, getting started is effortless. The theme includes a prominent banner section to highlight key updates or admissions. A dedicated course grid layout allows institutes to display available programs or classes clearly. The latest blog section is perfect for sharing academic news, study tips, or events. Flex Education also supports custom post types for better content organization. Built with Elementor, it offers flexibility to customize pages without any coding. Whether you’re creating a website for an online learning platform, kindergarten, high school, or professional training institute, Flex Education gives you the essential tools to build an informative, visually appealing, and responsive website. It’s crafted for educators, institutions, and course creators who want a professional web presence without complexity. This theme integrates smoothly with popular plugins like Advanced Custom Fields to enhance content management and extend functionality for educational sites."
    },
